    "005": "SYST-005 UOP is the master device\nCause:  The attempted operation could not be done because the User Operator Panel is enabled.\nRemedy:  Set the remote/local operation mode to Local in the system configuration screen (if the operation is attempted from the\nSOP), or set the $RMT_MASTER system variable correctly. Set the variable to one of the following values:\n0:User Operator\n1:CRT/KB\n2:Host computer\n3:Remote device none\n4:RobotLink master",
    "006": "SYST-006 KCL is the master device\nCause:  The attempted operation could not be done because KCL is the master device.\nRemedy:  Set the remote/local operation mode to Local in the system configuration screen(if the operation is attempted from the\nSOP), or set the $RMT_MASTER system variable correctly. Set the variable to one of the following values:\n0:User Operator Panel\n1:CRT/KB\n2:Host computer\n3:Remote device none\n4:RobotLink master",
    "007": "SYST-007 NETWORK is the master device\nCause:  The attempted operation could not be done because the NETWORK command processor is the master device.\nRemedy:  Set the remote/local operation mode to Local in the system configuration screen (if the operation is attempted from the\nSOP), or set the $RMT_MASTER system variable correctly.\n0:User Operator Panel\n1:CRT/KB\n2:Host computer\n3:Remote device none\n4:RobotLink master",
    "008": "SYST-008 Nothing is the master device\nCause:  The system variable $RMT_MASTER is set to disable all devices. Therefore, no remote device can issue motion.\nRemedy:  Set the remote/local operation mode to Local in the system configuration screen (if the operation is attempted from the\nSOP), or set the $RMT_MASTER system variable correctly.\n0:User Operator Panel\n1:CRT/KB\n2:Host computer\n3:Remote device none\n4:RobotLink master",
    "009": "SYST-009 Safety Fence open\nCause:  The attempted operation could not be done because the safety fence is open.\nRemedy:  Close the safety fence, and try the same operation again.",
    "010": "SYST-010 Max num task reached\nCause:  The number of task has reached the maximum.\nRemedy:  Abort one of the running task.",
    "011": "SYST-011 Failed to run task\nCause:  The system has failed to run the program.",
