    "064": "SYST-064 Bad scan table data\nCause:  System error: Invalid data in scan table The following can result in this error: Too many cond/action sets (max = 10)\nInvalid condition code Invalid action code Too many actions (max = 3)\nRemedy:  Contact FANUC with information on events leading up to error.",
